288 0 obj
<<
/A 2145 0 R
/Alt (Circular infographic illustrating Raman spectroscopy for sentinel lymph node biopsy, divided into segments for conventional Raman spectroscopy, surface-enhanced Raman scattering \(SERS\), labeled and label-free SERS, and derivative Raman technologies. Graphics and charts highlight novel nanotracers, direct detection, spectral data, and labeled applications, while outer rings describe challenges such as low signal-to-noise ratio and prospects like AI-driven analysis and virtual histopathology. Central anatomical illustration marks tumor and sentinel lymph node.)
/K [55 2146 0 R]
/P 89 0 R
/Pg 51 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (SCHEME 1)
/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
