308 0 obj
<<
/A 2166 0 R
/Alt (Panel a contains a medical illustration explaining sentinel lymph node biopsy for breast cancer, showing dye injection, tracer movement to lymph nodes, and examination under a microscope. Panel b displays four black-and-white images of radioactive sentinel lymph node mapping with arrows indicating marked nodes. Panel c shows two color images of ICG fluorescence sentinel node mapping during transcutaneous and intraoperative identification. Panel d presents two gross pathology samples of bisected lymph nodes. Panel e provides a microscopic cytology image of a stained lymph node cell cluster. Panel f displays a histology slide with brown-stained regions, scale bar labeled 100 millimeters.)
/K [28 2167 0 R]
/P 95 0 R
/Pg 52 0 R
