/A 2284 0 R
/Alt (Panel a shows a chemical structure schematic of PEG-functionalized single-walled carbon nanotubes and a photograph of a sample vial, with a Raman spectrum plot. Panel b presents bar graphs and line graphs illustrating biodistribution and clearance of different PEGylated nanotube formulations across tissues and over time. Panel c includes photographs of a mouse with a dark injection spot, Raman imaging revealing nanoparticle distribution, corresponding Raman spectra, and zoomed imaging regions. Panel d shows photographs, Raman images, merged images, spectrum plots, and histological stains highlighting localization and analysis of PCPDT nanoparticles. Panel e displays noninvasive Raman imaging results merged with photographs, showing graded nanoparticle doses, corresponding Raman signals, and labeled regions of interest.)
/K [19 2285 0 R]
/P 123 0 R
/Pg 57 0 R
/S /Figure
