<<
/A 2434 0 R
/Alt (Composite scientific figure illustrating the procedure and analysis for sentinel lymph node \(SLN\) detection using Raman imaging. Panel a shows photographs and Raman images of mouse tissue with labeled SLN and fat, alongside intensity graphs. Panel b presents a schematic of the macro mapping setup and example Raman maps of tissue, with spectral data. Panel c captures intraoperative Raman diagnostics, spectral intensity comparison between metastatic and non-metastatic lymph nodes, a bar graph showing intensity differences, and histological stains of lymph nodes. Panel d explains the principle of Raman tags with diagrams, example spectra, and comparative imaging results. Panel e outlines procedural steps, from tracer injection to surgical SLN resection, supported by stepwise photos and Raman spectra.)
/K [7 2435 0 R]
/P 162 0 R
/Pg 63 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 7)
/Type /StructElem
>>
