591 0 obj
<<
/A 2462 0 R
/Alt (Scientific figure with multiple panels illustrating the development and application of GERRET nanoparticles for intraoperative guidance. Panel a shows a schematic of GERRET synthesis involving a petal-like core, IR-780 absorption, silver coating, and formation of a SERS-active layer. Panel b displays a line graph comparing normalized extinction spectra of different nanoparticle stages and IR-780 dye, highlighting SERS activity. Panel c presents visual, fluorescence, SERS, and overlay images for different lymph nodes, showing signal detection. Panel d provides a diagram of a laser-based probe setup for subsurface imaging. Panel e includes a schematic of the imaging setup, heatmaps from tissue scans, an MRI image, and a corresponding SERS image. Panel f depicts a diagram explaining bidirectional illumination. Panel g outlines a workflow from pre-operative planning \(with heatmaps and imaging\) through intra-operative guidance and post-operative examination, alongside photographs of surgical steps and a Raman spectrum chart.)
/K [0 2463 0 R]
/P 169 0 R
/Pg 65 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 8)
/Type /StructElem
>>
